  "body": "Open Home - Sunday 11:00 to 11:30am\r\n\r\nPicture Saturday starting with an unhurried coffee by the water at Half Moon Bay Marina, boats rocking in the morning light while the rest of Auckland sits in traffic. Come Monday, the ferry turns your commute into a harbour crossing, and summer evenings end with dinner by the water.\r\n\r\nThat's the life on offer at Chesley Place. And because this classic brick and tile home is completely vacant, it can start the day you settle.\r\n\r\nImmediate possession is available. No tenants to move on and no drawn-out wait. Just collect the keys and move in.\r\n\r\nStep inside and everything sits on one level. The open-plan living and dining area is bright and relaxed, letting conversation move naturally from the table to the couch, ready for long dinners with friends or quiet nights in.\r\n\r\nDown the hall, two light-filled bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, offer calm, uncluttered spaces to rest. A separate bathroom and dedicated laundry keep daily routines simple, and the covered carport means no wet dashes to the car.\r\n\r\nSolid brick and tile construction keeps maintenance low, so your weekends go to the marina, not the ladder and paint tray. Want to make it your own? Add value over time with a cosmetic refresh.\r\n\r\n- 2 bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes\r\n- 1 separate bathroom\r\n- Open-plan living and dining\r\n- Dedicated laundry\r\n- Covered carport\r\n- Single-level brick and tile construction\r\n- Vacant, immediate possession available\r\n\r\nHalf Moon Bay Marina with its ferry terminal, cafes and shops, local supermarkets, Pakuranga College and Howick Village are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nDownsizing? Swap the upkeep of a large property for an easy, lock-and-leave base close to the water.\r\nBuying your first home? Get your foothold in a sought-after coastal postcode and grow with it.\r\nInvesting? A solid, low-maintenance asset, vacant and ready for the right tenant.\r\n\r\nThe home is empty and the keys are ready, so now is the time to take a look.\r\n\r\nCall Angus Chan on 021 021 63388. Happy to walk you through the home, the neighbourhood and the buying process. Can't make an open home? Just ask for a private viewing at a time that suits you.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The website may have filtered the property into a price bracket for functionality purposes. All prospective purchasers shall complete their own due diligence, seek legal and expert advice, and satisfy themselves with respect to all information supplied during the marketing of this property, including but not limited to the floor and land sizes, boundary lines, underground services, and any scheme plans or consents.",
